<!DOCTYPE airframe SYSTEM "../airframe.dtd">
<airframe name="Talon_250G">
  <description>
    Fun Fixedwing airframe equipped with a MATEKSYS F405TE V3 or compatible flightcontroller hardware

    + Model:       ZoHD Talon 250G
    + Autopilot:   MATEKSYSF405TE compatible FlyingRC F405 v1.5
    + Actuators:   PDI 1143HB 4.3g servos
    + GNSS         Ublox M10 GNSS
    + MAG          External QMC Magnetometer on GNSS device
    + ESC:         AM32 20A ESC
    + RCRX:        TBS Nano Receiver
    + AIRSPEED:    SDP33 nano
    + TELEMETRY:   ESP32C3 with 
    + CURRENT:     None
    + RANGER:      None
    + MOTOR:       Default 1406-2600KV Outrunner Brushless
    + PROP:        Two blade 5" x 5" 

    NOTES:
    + ServoPins on PCB point to tail of airframe
    + The FC PCB is mounted with the F4 Processor towards the top of the airframe
    + Battery voltage and current via onboard sensor
    + 2nd motor current values via additional external sensor
    + Servos powered via BEC on FC
    + Flightcontroller powered via FC Onboard BEC
    + Telemetry powered via FC
    + C3 Chip based with firmware enabling real mesh
    + Uploading of the firmware can be performed via ARDU bootloader flased via USB, or boot button STM32
    + On I2C we have external magneto and Airspeed sensor
    + GNSS set to ~19Hz update rate, 4 constelations, SBAS enabled
    + Advised battery for this airframe is a 3300mAh 2S LiIon min. 5C
    + ESC set to fixed endpoints 1100-1900us
    + Taking 100mA the ESPC3 modem powered via FC 3v3
    + RC RX powered via FC 5v
  </description>

